# --- VM transfer artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# Payloads and result bundles moved to and from the compute VM. Always a
# duplicate of a directory that is already here; 40_states.tar alone was 727 MB.
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# --- OneDrive duplicate-on-sync artefacts ----------------------------------
# A single sync event on 2026-07-27 produced 2,423 of these, byte-identical to
# their originals and 20.8 GB in total. Nothing references them: the " - Copy"
# suffix means no script can find one by name.
* - Copy.*

# --- generated figure inputs ------------------------------------------------
# Rebuilt by the scripts in "Manuscript scripts/". The twelve already tracked
# here stay tracked -- an ignore rule never untracks anything.
Manuscript data/*.rds
Manuscript data/*.csv

# --- run logs ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- regenerable analysis outputs -------------------------------------------
# The scripts that produce these ARE tracked, so the outputs are reproducible.
Krill counterfactual scenarios/analysis/
Reference model diet assessment/analysis/
Reference model diet assessment/benchmarks/
Reference model diet assessment/recalibrated_54/
Manuscript analysis/*.csv
Manuscript analysis/*.rds
output/

